--- !u!114 &144756738
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 144756735}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 08b3abb0d6207db48a20081964542afc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HiliaDialogue
  openIntroductionOnStart: 1
  introduction:
  - speaker: Abu Rashid (walkie)
    text: Shamma! Small problem before the mountain. Can you stop at Hili?
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab71d5c27bd25ff49839b64d814a43b0, type: 3}
  - speaker: Shamma
    text: The round tomb?
    portrait: {fileID: -9194766335657822751, guid: bc57356b113f46e45b17c116df5471f6, type: 3}
  - speaker: Abu Rashid (walkie)
    text: The Grand Tomb. More than 4,000 years old.
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab71d5c27bd25ff49839b64d814a43b0, type: 3}
  - speaker: Abu Rashid (walkie)
    text: The carved stones were placed back in the wrong order.
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab71d5c27bd25ff49839b64d814a43b0, type: 3}
  - speaker: Shamma
    text: I will fix it.
    portrait: {fileID: -9194766335657822751, guid: bc57356b113f46e45b17c116df5471f6, type: 3}
  howToPlay:
  - speaker: Abu Rashid | How to play
    text: Walk up to the lever in front of the tomb. Press E, click the lever, or
      tap Use lever.
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab71d5c27bd25ff49839b64d814a43b0, type: 3}
  - speaker: Abu Rashid | How to play
    text: Each press changes all four carvings. Put two people in the middle, with
      an oryx on each side, to open the gate.
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab71d5c27bd25ff49839b64d814a43b0, type: 3}
  hint:
  - speaker: Hint
    text: The ancient builders put people at the heart, with an oryx guarding each
      side.
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab71d5c27bd25ff49839b64d814a43b0, type: 3}
  solved:
  - speaker: Shamma (solved)
    text: Two people in the middle, protected on both sides.
    portrait: {fileID: -9194766335657822751, guid: bc57356b113f46e45b17c116df5471f6, type: 3}
  - speaker: Abu Rashid (solved)
    text: Families were laid to rest here together. Even then, Al Ain was a community.
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab71d5c27bd25ff49839b64d814a43b0, type: 3}
  - speaker: Carved Stone
    text: Carved Stone earned.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  panel: {fileID: 1645750688}
  speakerLabel: {fileID: 563315920}
  wordsLabel: {fileID: 1799684541}
  pageLabel: {fileID: 776147229}
  nextLabel: {fileID: 2049425641}
